# Banking the pass before every affected group is republished.
MODULE: CheckpointAfterPublicationEarly
TARGET: CheckpointAfterPublication
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the checkpoint advances while an affected-group intent is still outstanding
PERTURBS: Checkpoint

--- FIND
    /\ Live /\ phase = "idle" /\ checkpoint # read /\ intent = NoIntent
    /\ checkpoint' = read
--- REPLACE
    /\ Live /\ checkpoint # read
    /\ checkpoint' = read
--- END
